    "chunk_text": "abel eode mid blysse to \u00feam unrihtwisan cyninge, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 him \u00f0us to, Aris nu and \u00dea aras se arleasa, and ferde to Nabo\u00f0es winearde wolde hine habban. \u00dea com him gangende to se Godes witega Helias, asend fram Gode and s\u00e6de him \u00f0as word, \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0 Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a \u00e6fter fyrste ferde Achab se cyning togeanes Syrian cynincge mid swy\u00f0licre fyrdinge, wolde \u00dea het Syrian cyning sona his cepan, \u00fe\u00e6t he ana feolle of eallum his folce. \u00dea gebende an scytta sona his bogan and ascet ana flan swylce on ungewis, and at\u00e6sde \u00f0one cyning \u00dea gewende his here aweg swy\u00f0e hra\u00f0e and leddon \u00f0one cyning on his cr\u00e6te swa deadne, and his blod \u00d0a feng his sunu sona to his rice, Oozias gehaten swy\u00f0e yfeld\u00e6da. He ferde swa swa his forcu\u00f0a f\u00e6der and swa swa his fracode modor him yfele gebysnodon, and He feoll of anre st\u00e6gere, and for\u00f0y gel\u00e6g. Sende \u00f0a to h\u00e6\u00f0engilde het axian be him, and Helias gemette \u00fea menn \u00f0e he asende, cw\u00e6\u00f0 him sona Nu cw\u00e6\u00f0 se \u00e6lmihtiga for\u00f0i, \u00fe\u00e6t se cynincg ne sceall arisan of \u00f0am bedde \u00fee he on li\u00f0, ac sceall beon \u00dea gewendon \u00f0a \u00e6rendracan eft to \u00f0am cynincge, and cyddon hw\u00e6t se witega him be wege s\u00e6de. \u00dea sende se cyning sona fiftig manna to \u00f0am Godes witegan, wolde hine gelangian. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0",
